{
  "id": "gear_trains___bicycle_gearing_calculator",
  "title": "Gear Trains - Bicycle Gearing Calculator",
  "description": "Calculate bicycle wheel distance traveled based on pedaling revolutions, chainset teeth, and cassette teeth. Supports both SI and Imperial units.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Bicycle Gearing Calculator\n\nCalculate the distance traveled by a bicycle wheel based on pedaling revolutions, chainset sprocket teeth, cassette sprocket teeth, and wheel diameter.\n\n**Formula:**\n\n_l = π d nD tD / tF_\n\nWhere:\n- **l** = distance traveled (m, in)\n- **d** = outer wheel diameter (m, in)\n- **nD** = revolutions of pedaling (rpm)\n- **tD** = number of teeth in pedaling sprocket (chainset)\n- **tF** = number of teeth in wheel sprocket (cassette)\n- **π** = 3.14159..."
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "wheel_diameter",
          "label": "Wheel Diameter",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 26,
          "unit": "in"
        },
        {
          "id": "pedal_revolutions",
          "label": "Pedaling Revolutions",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1,
          "unit": "rpm"
        },
        {
          "id": "chainset_teeth",
          "label": "Chainset Sprocket Teeth (nD)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 42,
          "unit": "teeth"
        },
        {
          "id": "cassette_teeth",
          "label": "Cassette Sprocket Teeth (tF)",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 14,
          "unit": "teeth"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "distance_traveled",
          "label": "Distance Traveled",
          "formula": "3.14159 * inputs.wheel_diameter * inputs.pedal_revolutions * inputs.chainset_teeth / inputs.cassette_teeth",
          "unit": "distance",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "movement_ratio",
          "label": "Movement Ratio (nF/nD)",
          "formula": "inputs.chainset_teeth / inputs.cassette_teeth",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "wheel_circumference",
          "label": "Wheel Circumference",
          "formula": "3.14159 * inputs.wheel_diameter",
          "unit": "distance",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Type of Gear Set",
        "Min Ratio",
        "Max Ratio"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Spur gear, external",
          "1:1",
          "5:1"
        ],
        [
          "Spur gear, internal",
          "1.5:1",
          "7:1"
        ],
        [
          "Helical gear, external",
          "1:1",
          "10:1"
        ],
        [
          "Helical gear, internal",
          "1.5:1",
          "10:1"
        ],
        [
          "Straight bevel gear",
          "1:1",
          "8:1"
        ],
        [
          "Spiral bevel gear",
          "1:1",
          "8:1"
        ],
        [
          "Epicyclic planetary gear",
          "3:1",
          "12:1"
        ],
        [
          "Epicyclic star gear",
          "2:1",
          "11:1"
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
}